title: "QCC: Quantum Circuit Controller"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Savvaidis
    given-names: Ioannis
    affiliation: "Democritus University of Thrace"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ioaiaaii/quantum-circuit-controller"
url: "https://ioaiaaii.github.io/project/msc-thesis/"
abstract: >-
  A control plane for the quantum-classical interface. QCC brings
  declarative infrastructure, lifecycle orchestration, and standards-based
  observability to hybrid quantum-classical execution, treating quantum
  circuits and the backends that execute them as observable, schedulable
  resources. It is the proof-of-concept artifact of the MSc thesis
  "Interface between Quantum and Classical Computers".
keywords:
  - quantum computing
  - quantum-classical interface
  - hybrid quantum-classical execution
  - kubernetes
  - operator
  - observability
  - opentelemetry
  - site reliability engineering
  - qiskit
